  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nJavascript code for validate is stored in dictionary key '/V'.  \nAnd the value of (text) field is stored in dictionary key '/V'.  \nBy overlapping both dictionary key and remove '/V' key during validate event, can cause dangling CPDF_Dictionary pointer.  \n  \nAttached file"
